extend type Query {
  """
  Force recipes whose products contain the given item, optionally restricted to enabled or disabled recipes, read from
  the force recipe catalogue in one snapshot, sorted by recipe name and paginated with limit 1..10000 and a zero-based
  offset. The enabled argument is a tri-state filter: omitting it returns enabled and disabled recipes alike, and only
  products are matched by prototype name — ingredients are never searched. Hidden recipes, which include every recycling
  and parameter recipe, are excluded unless includeHidden is true; each recipe reports its own hidden flag so a filtered
  list can still be recognized. Each recipe exposes its category, additional categories, energy, handCraftable (the
  actor-free character crafting categories gather, wood and other hand recipes), raw ingredient and product lists plus
  craftingMachines: every assembling machine, furnace or rocket-silo prototype whose crafting categories intersect the
  recipe's category or any additional category, which does not assert that such a machine is built, researched or
  otherwise available to the force. pageInfo.total counts all matching recipes before pagination, and an empty recipes
  list means no recipe produces the item. Empty force or item names, an unknown force name, or out-of-range
  limit/offset produce a GraphQL error; the query changes no state and emits no notification.
  """
  itemRecipes(input: ItemRecipesInput!): ItemRecipePage!
}
"""Force and item must be non-empty. Limit is 1 through 10000; offset is zero-based and non-negative. includeHidden defaults to false because recycling and parameter recipes otherwise bury every real recipe."""
input ItemRecipesInput { force: String! = "player" item: String! enabled: Boolean includeHidden: Boolean! = false limit: Int! = 100 offset: Int! = 0 }
"""Crafting machines are entity prototype names whose crafting categories intersect the recipe category or one of its additional categories, not necessarily built or available to the force."""
type ItemRecipe { name: String! enabled: Boolean! hidden: Boolean! category: String! """Recipe additional_categories; empty when the recipe has none.""" additionalCategories: [String!]! energy: Float! """True when the character can hand-craft it: its category or an additional category is a character crafting category such as crafting or advanced-crafting.""" handCraftable: Boolean! ingredients: [RecipeIngredient!]! products: [RecipeProduct!]! craftingMachines: [String!]! }
"""Total counts matching recipes before pagination."""
type ItemRecipePage { tick: Float! force: String! item: String! pageInfo: PageInfo! recipes: [ItemRecipe!]! }
